<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>우리 회사</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    header { background: #333; color: white; padding: 1em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    header nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 1em; }
    section { padding: 4em 2em; min-height: 100vh; }
    #about { background: #f9f9f9; }
    #contact { background: #e0e0e0; }
    button { padding: 0.8em 1.5em; font-size: 1em; cursor: pointer; background: #333; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 1em; }
    form input, form textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 0.5em 0; padding: 0.5em; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
    form button { margin-top: 1em; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 헤더 -->
  <header>
    <h1>우리 회사</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">회사 소개</a>
      <a href="#contact">고객 문의</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- 회사 소개 섹션 -->
  <section id="about">
    <h2>회사 소개</h2>
    <p>우리 회사는 최고의 서비스를 제공합니다. 고객 만족을 최우선으로 합니다.</p>
    <!-- 고객 문의 버튼 -->
    <button onclick="location.href='#contact'">고객 문의 바로가기</button>
  </section>

  <!-- 고객 문의 섹션 -->
  <section id="contact">
    <h2>고객 문의</h2>
    <form action="https://formspree.io/f/yourformid" method="POST">
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="이름" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="이메일" required>
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="문의 내용" rows="5" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit">전송</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
